OL,3,GNEWSASpecial school process feels like
OL,4,Aa 'complete lottery'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman whose daughter has profound
OL,7,Fneeds has described the process of
OL,8,Fenrolling children to Special
OL,9,FEducational Needs (SEN) schools as
OL,10,Ffeeling like a "complete lottery".
OL,12,FIt comes as the Education Authority
OL,13,Fannounced that all SEN schools in
OL,14,FNorthern Ireland are full.
OL,16,FIn their operational plan for 2026/27,
OL,17,Fthe EA said in some SEN schools pupil
OL,18,Fnumbers have doubled in the past
OL,19,Fdecade.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
