OL,3,GNEWSASpecial school process feels like
OL,4,Aa 'complete lottery'
OL,5,
OL,6,FKaren Ryan whose 17-year-old daughter,
OL,7,FEmily, goes to a SEN school, said
OL,8,Fthroughout the years, she has seen
OL,9,Fenrolment levels change since the
OL,10,Fpandemic where nursery provision was
OL,11,Fstopped.
